  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners Research Conference 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Orange Corners Research Conference 2026 will showcase the results of two years of practice-oriented and data-driven research conducted under the Orange Corners programme. During the conference, the project partners will share insights on the impact of entrepreneurship support programmes in Africa, the Middle East and Bangladesh, and discuss how this knowledge can contribute to better policy, more effective implementation and sustainable development. The conference brings together researchers, policymakers and implementers to demonstrate how the outcomes of scientific research can be applied to better support entrepreneurs in low- and middle-income countries.</narrative>
  </description>
